# What starts with the desktop, one command a line, run with `sh -c`. Yours goes
# in ~/.config/pleamar/autostart: pleamar-wm's session runs it, and on another
# compositor (Hyprland: `exec-once = pleamar --autostart`) so does pleamar.
# A line that only makes sense in pleamar-wm's session starts with `wm:`.
#
# The wallpaper: the one Marea has saved (session.sh reads it), under everything.
wm: swaybg -i "${PLEAMAR_WALLPAPER:-/usr/share/wallpapers/cachyos-wallpapers/GreenFeathers.png}" -m fill
# Marea, as a program of the session (layer-shell), as she is on Hyprland.
marea start
